0 2 "// obj is the code's object (co_* attributes), one per code so that frame.f_code is func.__code__ (queue 219t)"] [56 1 "// codePos is an instruction's end line and columns (0-based UTF-8 byte offsets), Col -1 when unknown: co_positions'"] [57 1 "// last three items (the first, the line, is Lines')."] [65 1 "// debugRanges is config.code_debug_ranges: false under -X no_debug_ranges or PYTHONNODEBUGRANGES (the code objects then"] [66 1 "// carry no columns: co_positions' None, no caret lines)"] [75 1 "// Position is instruction pc's location as co_positions gives it: line, end line, column, end column, each 0 when"] [76 1 "// unknown (ok false for the columns)."] [88 1 "// compileWarning is a SyntaxWarning the compiler made: its message and location (1-based offsets, 0 unknown)."] [94 1 "// NativeFunc is a code object's compiled body (PY8's AOT, aot.go): it runs f from f.PC as step does"] [95 1 "// (the value returned, an error raised, or a *pushFrame for a call of a Python function)."] [98 1 "// CodeKind is the IR's :kind."] [113 1 "// CodeFlags are the IR's :flags."] [124 24 "// CO_ITERABLE_COROUTINE: a generator types.coroutine marked (set at run time, PY5d)"] [127 1 "// Instr is an instruction: the operation and its argument decoded into two integers (§7.2's table:"] [128 1 "// an index, a count, a jump target, an operator, a flag ...)."] [134 1 "// Handler is a row of the exception table: instructions [Start, End) go to Target with the stack"] [135 1 "// popped to Depth, then the instruction's index pushed when Lasti, then the exception."] [141 1 "// Make-function's parts (the IR's [CONST PARTS]), as a bit set in B."] [149 1 "// Intrinsic is the IR's :call-intrinsic NAME (§3.4)."] [170 1 "// Object is c's code object, the same each time (f_code, __code__, gi_code: CPython's one PyCodeObject; queue 219t)."] [178 1 "// handlerAt is the handler covering instruction pc, or nil."] [189 1 "// Line is instruction pc's line, 0 when unknown."] [197 1 "// OpNames is the IR's operations the loader knows, in Op order (bin/pyi runtime check compares them"] [198 1 "// with arbace.python.ir/ops)."] [201 1 "// OpOwners is each operation's owner (PYI-SPEC.md §9), in Op order."] [204 1 "// SetFilename sets the code object's co_filename and its nested code objects'."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[81 26] [208 31]] :go/trails [[167 75]]} (go/file "code.go" :imports [

